& [Review]
  + source lineage host target protected roots artifact/receipt shapes effects threats measurements evidence acceptance and phase transitions are explicit
  + current build replay and future Cantor-directed build work are correctly separated
  + provider-free A8 replay supplies a meaningful first executable test without coupling success to llama.cpp availability or model quality
  + optional query cannot escape the pilot root and truthful incompatibility is accepted

& [Residuals]
  + exact binary hashes package membership ACL status timings and optional query outcome are implementation/live evidence and cannot be known at formation
  + SSH and host administration remain operational trust dependencies; P0 is not a signed production installer

& [Decision]
  + ready for independent dual-PowerShell formation verification and publication; implementation remains locked until the bookend
